---
import MotionStage from './motion-stage.astro';
---
<MotionStage label="illustrative design-to-delivery workflow" class="workflow-stage">
  <div class="workflow-top"><span>From intent to interface</span><span>Illustrative workflow / 01—03</span></div>
  <div class="workflow-scenes">
    <div class="workflow-panel workflow-design"><span class="workflow-step">01 / Define the intent</span><div class="workflow-appointment"><span class="workflow-tiny">Appointment · default</span><span class="workflow-avatar" aria-hidden="true">+</span><strong>A little closer<br/>to better care.</strong><p>A clear next step, in either language.</p><span class="workflow-cta">Find an appointment <span>↗</span></span></div><div class="workflow-tokens"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>Tokens. States. Behaviour.</span></div></div>
    <span class="workflow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <div class="workflow-panel workflow-code"><span class="workflow-step">02 / Build with context</span><div class="workflow-editor"><span class="workflow-file">Appointment.tsx</span><code><span>&lt;AppointmentCard</span><span>  variant="primary"</span><span>  locale="en"</span><span>  state="available"</span><span>/&gt;</span></code><div class="workflow-review"><span class="workflow-tiny">03 / Human review</span><strong>Intent preserved?</strong><p>Accessibility · RTL · Edge cases</p></div></div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="workflow-caption">AI helps with the making. People own the decisions.</p>
</MotionStage>
